[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4142.39, "timestamp": "01:09:02", "text": "六个你不应该购买的理由"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4144.309, "timestamp": "01:09:04", "text": "蓝牙键盘。我指的是麦克风。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4146.07, "timestamp": "01:09:06", "text": "好的。好的。好的。好的。是的，你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4148.229, "timestamp": "01:09:08", "text": "正确的。你说得对。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4151.269, "timestamp": "01:09:11", "text": "很久"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4163.669, "timestamp": "01:09:23", "text": "剃刀"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4166.87, "timestamp": "01:09:26", "text": "迷宫。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4169.51, "timestamp": "01:09:29", "text": "标准变得过时了。是的。更高"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4187.929, "timestamp": "01:09:47", "text": "是的。现在我吸取了教训。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4192.39, "timestamp": "01:09:52", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4195.43, "timestamp": "01:09:55", "text": "因为我大部分时间都在玩游戏。我当时没想那么多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4198.39, "timestamp": "01:09:58", "text": "关于它。我主要是在寻找"}]